        <summary ToolPath="Untrimmed" tool="FirstSentenceInJavadocToMdoc">
          <para>A type of policy that this device admin can use: disables use of all device cameras.</para>
          <para>To control this policy, the device admin must be a device owner or profile owner, and must have a "disable-camera" tag in the "uses-policies" section of its meta-data. If used by a device owner, the policy affects all users on the device.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/app/admin/DeviceAdminInfo#USES_POLICY_DISABLE_CAMERA" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.app.admin.DeviceAdminInfo.USES_POLICY_DISABLE_CAMERA</code>.</a></format></para>
