        <summary ToolPath="Untrimmed" tool="FirstSentenceInJavadocToMdoc">
          <para>A type of policy that this device admin can use: force the user to change their password after an administrator-defined time limit.</para>
          <para>To control this policy, the device admin must be a device owner or profile owner, and must have an "expire-password" tag in the "uses-policies" section of its meta-data. If used by a device owner, the policy only affects the primary user and its profiles, but not any secondary users on the device.</para>
