        <summary ToolPath="Untrimmed" tool="FirstSentenceInJavadocToMdoc">
          <para>A type of policy that this device admin can use: able to force the device to lock viaDevicePolicyManager.lockNow or limit the maximum lock timeout for the device via DevicePolicyManager.setMaximumTimeToLock.</para>
          <para>To control this policy, the device admin must have a "force-lock" tag in the "uses-policies" section of its meta-data.</para>
