        <summary ToolPath="Untrimmed" tool="FirstSentenceInJavadocToMdoc">
          <para>A type of policy that this device admin can use: able to factory reset the device, erasing all of the user's data, via DevicePolicyManager.wipeData.</para>
          <para>To control this policy, the device admin must have a "wipe-data" tag in the "uses-policies" section of its meta-data.</para>
